me and reputation high. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new items and bonuses for your casino using the Market Research tree. Will you rig the system or legally maximize fun? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your A team: Level up your Pitbosses to oversee your employees, increase your loyalty, engage with them, and unlock specific skills for your management. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388580/extras/c0c2d761ac502005b8599f9d1b364da2.poster.avif?t=1751979714\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388580/extras/c0c2d761ac502005b8599f9d1b364da2.webm?t=1751979714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388580/extras/c0c2d761ac502005b8599f9d1b364da2.mp4?t=1751979714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388580/extras/BBC_StoreTextHeading_TheDrama_EN.png?t=1751979714\" /></div>Blooming Business: Casino is not just your standard tycoon game, you\u2019ll progress through 11 narrative missions and face increasing challenges as you try to cater to the demanding and sometimes competing needs of the VIPs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each VIP has different skills and unique backstories that you can align with to shape your Casino business. Who will you side with?  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accomplish missions to get to know them. You\u2019ll need them on your side so it will be vital to connect with them and learn their backstories to satisfy their goals and desires throughout the missions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Specialize your casino and adapt your management to cater to their craziest pet peeves for big rewards! Your choices will impact their behaviours and your gameplay experience. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388580/extras/9097dac9eacf70f3d126072a73dbaabd.poster.avif?t=1751979714\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388580/extras/9097dac9eacf70f3d126072a73dbaabd.webm?t=1751979714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388580/extras/9097dac9eacf70f3d126072a73dbaabd.mp4?t=1751979714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388580/extras/BBC_StoreTextHeading_GameModes_EN.png?t=1751979714\" /></div>Play the game in one of 2 main modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Campaign</strong> \u2013 will show you the ropes and introduce you to the VIP\u2019s and the rich narrative landscape that makes up Las Venas. You\u2019ll make choices here that influence how your Casino career will play out! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sandbox modes</strong> \u2013 Casino types, items, decorations and Casino games are open for you to run your Casino and manage your business however you please!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t play against the House, be the House\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388580/extras/15d5729e4fb10863ba86e20f3e79096b.poster.avif?t=1751979714\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388580/extras/15d5729e4fb10863ba86e20f3e79096b.webm?t=1751979714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1388580/extras/15d5729e4fb10863ba86e20f3e79096b.mp4?t=1751979714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Build your casino empire in Las Venas alongside cute animals! Blooming Business: Casino is a cosy management game. Build and run your casino in a bustling world full of drama. Complete quests and manage your clientele. Keep everyone happy, from the clients, to the employees (and beware of the bear).",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cLooking for a unique business sim to get stuck into amid the sea of similar titles vying for our attention?  Then Blooming Business: Casino is definitely one of the more exciting - and more accessible - games of the bunch.\u201d<br>The Gamer<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s an in-depth business sim full of fun building variety to make your casino attractive, varied clients and employees to keep in line, and plenty of stats to track it all. The twist of VIP clients also spices up the game by throwing a wrench into your usual flow that you\u2019ll have to work out if you want to keep the dice rolling and the drinks flowing.\u201d<br>Shacknews<br><br>\u201cThe design of VIP is very interesting, little animals are not just 'cute'.\u201d<br>YYSTV<br>",
